      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "鲁道夫象征也曾在该赛大获全胜，\n展现异于常人的强悍才能，\n为什么她会选择这个比赛呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "9abc02d1394bc797e3a28d5a41dc5b7488319c951be75c70937f793fe8ed1332",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
