      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在“皋月赏”展现了实力之后，\n天狼星象征的跑法没有丝毫迷惘。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cb20a8e01a5d877e49fb6b50140c0584eecfce9e35fa06271aaafec86ea486d0",
