    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c9ffb6b82297528983dcacef",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "天狼星象征真正的目标是，\n总有一天站在世界顶点发出灿烂的光辉。",
      "source_fingerprint": "85c0d4087b38c3c99af9cc7b27c31df78b00c64048d3e85bdbe20d415592a30a",
