      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "然而，当她回到学园时，\n等待她的却是要不要成为\n鲁道夫象征“随行人员”的邀请。",
      "source_fingerprint": "81b847a6ab612ac61864997d1c98f8e4ede391e8284beda80c9ceb7a645d8dd4",
